  "@type": "Dataset",
  "@id": "https://cancer-data-showcase.vercel.app/datasets/gdc-ctsp-dlbcl1",
  "name": "CTSP Diffuse Large B-Cell Lymphoma (DLBCL) CALGB 50303",
  "alternateName": [
    "CTSP-DLBCL1"
  ],
  "description": "What makes this cohort worth knowing about is not its size but its provenance. The samples come from CALGB 50303, a randomized phase III trial comparing dose-adjusted EPOCH-R against R-CHOP as frontline therapy for diffuse large B-cell lymphoma. Molecular data collected inside a randomized trial are scarce: treatment assignment is not confounded with patient characteristics, which is the assumption that almost every observational treatment-response analysis has to make and cannot verify.\nVital status is informative for 100% of the 45 cases and median follow-up is 60.4 months. RNA sequencing covers 44 cases, exome 44 and a targeted panel all 45.",
  "url": "https://cancer-data-showcase.vercel.app/datasets/gdc-ctsp-dlbcl1",
